slocation across the endoplasmic reticulum (ER). All subunits are required for a maximal enzyme activity (By similarity)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}